### ==========================================
### PUBLIC AFFILIATE PRODUCTS
### ==========================================

### List products

GET http://localhost:8000/api/public/products
Accept: application/json


### ==========================================
### PRODUCT DETAILS
### ==========================================

GET http://localhost:8000/api/public/products/example-ai-pro
Accept: application/json


### Search products

GET http://localhost:8000/api/public/products?search=AI
Accept: application/json

### Search products
GET http://localhost:8000/api/public/products?search=productivity
Accept: application/json



### Products by category

GET http://localhost:8000/api/public/products?category=ai-tools
Accept: application/json



### Product pagination

GET http://localhost:8000/api/public/products?page=1&per_page=5
Accept: application/json

### Product Details

GET http://localhost:8000/api/public/products/example-ai-pro
Accept: application/json

